{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893830/extras/cdcef07b63cb4c86af5db7421a6744df.avif?t=1771519584\" width=1560 height=93 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Brew or Die. Literally!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Waking up to a knock on the door, you find an unambiguous letter: <strong>a huge debt</strong>, the deadline for which is approaching very soon. The jokes are over. Your only chance to save your skin is to revive a long-abandoned shop. Thus begins your desperate (and somewhat crazy) adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893830/extras/dd6d1d6e9ddb9e883952bc9e5d5367a7.poster.avif?t=1771519584\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893830/extras/dd6d1d6e9ddb9e883952bc9e5d5367a7.webm?t=1771519584\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893830/extras/dd6d1d6e9ddb9e883952bc9e5d5367a7.mp4?t=1771519584\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your new weapon? Potions!</strong>\u00a0Digging through the junk, you stumble upon an old textbook on potion-making, inherited from your father. Brilliant! After all, what could be more in demand in this village than magical brews? But there's a catch: <strong>there are no ingredients</strong>. And the most valuable (and dangerous) components \u2013 like the fangs of swamp creatures or the eyes of forest spirits \u2013 can only be obtained in dungeons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893830/extras/cdcef07b63cb4c86af5db7421a6744df.avif?t=1771519584\" width=1560 height=93 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893830/extras/c72070d7647816b332c20a9d65527841.poster.avif?t=1771519584\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893830/extras/c72070d7647816b332c20a9d65527841.webm?t=1771519584\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893830/extras/c72070d7647816b332c20a9d65527841.mp4?t=1771519584\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What awaits you:</strong> <br>1. <strong>Become an Adventurer:</strong>\u00a0Obtain a license from the Guild of Adventurers. Without it, the path to mysterious dungeons teeming with monsters is closed. <br>2. <strong>Risk Your Life:</strong>\u00a0Explore <strong>various dangerous locations</strong>\u00a0in <strong>semi-turn-based battles</strong>. Fight monsters, gather rare plants, and... harvest necessary &quot;organics.&quot; <br>3. <strong>Brew and Survive:</strong>\u00a0Use your loot for <strong>crafting and potion-making</strong>! Experiment with recipes, create healing, combat, and just plain strange potions. <br>4. <strong>Transform the Shop:</strong>\u00a0Sell your creations! <strong>Upgrade your shop</strong>\u00a0\u2013 expand your inventory, make displays more attractive, raise prices (after all, the debt is not small!). <br>5. <strong>Grow the Foundation:</strong>\u00a0Start a garden! <strong>Gardening</strong>\u00a0is the key to stable supplies of simpler, yet equally important ingredients for your potions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893830/extras/3699a5ae6d87e50a7db6e0b5796c5871.poster.avif?t=1771519584\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893830/extras/3699a5ae6d87e50a7db6e0b5796c5871.webm?t=1771519584\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893830/extras/3699a5ae6d87e50a7db6e0b5796c5871.mp4?t=1771519584\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893830/extras/cdcef07b63cb4c86af5db7421a6744df.avif?t=1771519584\" width=1560 height=93 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you turn the chaos of dungeons and the magic of the cauldron into gold coins?</strong>\u00a0Manage the shop, take risks on adventures, brew, sell, and <strong>fend off creditors</strong>\u00a0in Brew or Die \u2013 a game where potion-making is a matter of life, debt, and... potential wealth!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893830/extras/d50d4bd1db5c8b5545ef60a3976f76c3.poster.avif?t=1771519584\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893830/extras/d50d4bd1db5c8b5545ef60a3976f76c3.webm?t=1771519584\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893830/extras/d50d4bd1db5c8b5545ef60a3976f76c3.mp4?t=1771519584\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_i